 product RTL or runtime behavior changes.\n\nAuthor verification passed: both normal builds (1,411 checks); intended compile refusals; dropped-binding negative and child-default positive controls; lint and documentation checks. [Complete author receipts](https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/tree/8b61b6cf8a6bd445ee5d54103813e5d72d04af98/review-evidence/97-r1) retain commands, diagnostics, mutations and source hashes. Local Verilator was 5.052; hosted 5.050 and the complete native sweep remain required.\n\nDraft while manager validation runs. Assigned reviewers: R229 (independent internal Codex) and R230 (external Opus). Two independent positive reviews, clean five-lens coverage, exact candidate validation and post-merge containment are required. Standing automatic-merge authorization applies only after that bar. Parent submodule integration is separate.\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T06:49:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T07:52:44Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1a1f476b6f5dd0ebc35eb0d7e45b3ff08805735d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/100/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/100/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/100/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/statuses/1eb20dc4911880de10b745cc284e7dde306788b5","head":{"label":"Mister-M-alt:97-assert-distinct-sr-vid-fixture","ref":"97-assert-distinct-sr-vid-fixture","sha":"1eb20dc4911880de10b745cc284e7dde306788b5","user":{"logi